   "evidence": "`grep 'IsSeparated|T2Space \\(Points'` under PointTopology finds only this theorem's own hypothesis. The affine-case Hausdorff instance `instT2Space` in PointTopology/Separation.lean:59 requires `[T2Space R]`.",
