   "fix": "Change the phrase to \"for instance when `Z` is separated and `R` is Hausdorff (not proved here)\", or remove the example.",
   "issue": "The docstring says the points of `Z` are Hausdorff \"for instance when `Z` is separated\". Without `[T2Space R]` that is false: the points of the separated affine line `\ud835\udd38\u00b9_k` are `R` itself, which need not be Hausdorff. The repo also has no result deriving `T2Space (Points fZ)` from separatedness, so a reader is pointed to a hypothesis they cannot discharge.",
